From 1e483f686b81c0c82a649f5ae2b69f2e9639dc45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Repo Review <review@example.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:45:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] fix: replace Producer.flexiFlow with Producer.plainSink
 (type mismatch)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Producer.flexiFlow[K, V, PassThrough] expects a stream of
ProducerMessage.Envelope, not a bare ProducerRecord — the prior code
fed it a Source[ProducerRecord[String, String], _] directly, which is
a type mismatch that should fail sbt compile. The subsequent
result.offset / result.partition access also assumed a concrete
Result type rather than flexiFlow's actual sealed Results supertype.

This producer doesn't use the offset-commit / pass-through pattern
flexiFlow exists for, so plainSink is the right tool here: it accepts
a raw ProducerRecord directly and returns Future[Done] on stream
completion. Dropped the per-record offset/partition debug log along
with it, since plainSink doesn't expose per-record metadata — the
existing INFO log covers general producer activity.

Public API of KafkaProducerWithJwt.run() is unchanged (still
Future[Unit]), so no changes needed at the Main.scala call site.

I could not run sbt compile to confirm the original code failed to
build (no network access in the environment I used to review this) —
please verify with a clean build before/after this patch.
---
 .../com/example/jwtcache/KafkaProducerWithJwt.scala      | 9 ++-------
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/main/scala/com/example/jwtcache/KafkaProducerWithJwt.scala b/src/main/scala/com/example/jwtcache/KafkaProducerWithJwt.scala
index 7104f1f..05621e9 100644
--- a/src/main/scala/com/example/jwtcache/KafkaProducerWithJwt.scala
+++ b/src/main/scala/com/example/jwtcache/KafkaProducerWithJwt.scala
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ package com.example.jwtcache
 import akka.actor.typed.ActorSystem
 import akka.kafka.ProducerSettings
 import akka.kafka.scaladsl.Producer
-import akka.stream.scaladsl.{Sink, Source}
+import akka.stream.scaladsl.Source
 import org.apache.kafka.clients.producer.ProducerRecord
 import org.apache.kafka.common.serialization.StringSerializer
 import org.slf4j.LoggerFactory
@@ -62,12 +62,7 @@ class KafkaProducerWithJwt(
           new ProducerRecord[String, String](topic, s"key-${System.currentTimeMillis()}", payload)
         }
       }
-      .via(Producer.flexiFlow(producerSettings))
-      .map { result =>
-        log.debug("Produced offset={} partition={}", result.offset, result.partition)
-        result
-      }
-      .runWith(Sink.ignore)
+      .runWith(Producer.plainSink(producerSettings))
       .map(_ => ())
   }
 
